#: r2/lib/system_messages.py:62
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**gadzooks! you are invited to become a moderator of [%(title)s](%(url)s)!**\n"
"\n"
"*to accept*, visit the [moderators page for %(url)s](%(url)s/about/moderators) and click \"accept\".\n"
"\n"
"*otherwise,* if you did not expect to receive this, you can simply ignore this invitation or report it.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"*Before accepting, we encourage you to review our [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines) to understand the expectations and responsibilities of being a moderator.*"
msgstr ""
"**sejt! du er blevet inviteret til at blive moderator af [%(title)s](%(url)s)!**\n"
"\n"
"*for at tage imod invitationen* skal du gå til [moderatorsiden for %(url)s](%(url)s/about/moderators) og klikke på \"accepter\".\n"
"\n"
"*hvis du ikke* ventede invitationen, kan du bare ignorere den eller anmelde den.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"*Før du accepterer, anbefaler vi, at du læser vores [Retningslinjer for moderatorer](/help/moderatorguidelines), så du forstår, hvad der forventes af en moderator, og hvilket ansvar man har.*"

